WEBVTT

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:03.360
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.310
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:12.860
This summer, Tristar and Soleil will join forces and hold a Summer Tour.

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.540
Let the new unit, STAR☆ANIS, be born!

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.330
STAR☆ANIS...

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.340
Now, rise!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.910
Rise to ever greater heights, idols!

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:26.880
<i>The dream I had on that summer day has come true.</i>

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:30.920
<i>Kiriya Aoi's summer Aikatsu starts now!</i>

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.190
Tristar isn't coming?!

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:13.410
It's up to you three to handle this press conference.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.320
It's STAR☆ANIS's first job.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.320
You're leaving it to us...

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.930
Don't worry, we can do this!

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.030
Are the other members not coming today?

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:25.660
We were told that the entire unit would be here for the announcement.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:29.610
Mizuki-san and the others are abroad for a photo shoot.

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.810
Their flight was canceled due to inclement weather.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:34.210
In other words, they won't be appearing?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:36.660
A live video feed is currently being set up.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.170
Please be a bit more patient.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:41.180
You're just leaving them out to dry, Headmistress?

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.430
STAR☆ANIS doesn't stand a chance if they can't even overcome this little hurdle.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.430
It shouldn't take much longer, so please stay in your seats. {ugh... too many things}

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:51.050
He wants us to stall more?

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:52.060
How?

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.440
When do you think the feed will be ready?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.320
They're working on it.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:02.270
Everyone! The new unit formed by the combination of Tristar and Soleil

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:05.680
will be limited to a single summer of activity.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:06.700
We are STAR☆ANIS. {I kind of want to change this, but I have no idea how}

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:09.710
We're just about ready to go live.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.570
We actually have a very special plan in store...

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:14.960
Please tell us more about this plan.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:20.340
Thank you for waiting. We're finally ready to start the stream.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.220
Good morning. {afternoon? check time later}

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.400
We sincerely apologize for not meeting you all in person.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.870
Kanzaki Mizuki here.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.680
Hello, hello! Kaede's here too!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.350
Yurika-sama has descended from the bloody plateau of Transylvania.

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:37.500
STAR☆ANIS will be holding a summer tour throughout the nation.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.560
The more your expectations of us rise,

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.210
the hotter we will burn!

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.370
Right, girls?

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.740
That's right, Mizuki-san!

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.960
I'm the academy's headmistress, Mitsuishi.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.000
I have one more important announcement as well.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.250
This is a candid video stream of a certain unit.

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:58.200
Powa Powa Puririn's signature snack's gotta be Powa Powa Pudding.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.840
I respectfully disagree; I believe that white rice cakes would be more fitting. {unyu~}

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.380
Let's stick with salted rice crackers.

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:09.260
The girls you see here, Arisugawa Otome, Kitaouji Sakura, and Kamiya Shion,

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.020
have formed the independent unit Powa Powa Puririn.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.350
Is that a camera?

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:17.330
Are you shooting us?! {...}

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.080
Why didn't you tell us?!

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:22.320
These three will also be joining STAR☆ANIS.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.520
Take care of the rest.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:32.120
STAR☆ANIS has just grown to nine members.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.700
We're as sudden as a shooting star. {ephemeral, transient, etc} {sudden is good}

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:38.710
Blink and you'll miss another exciting moment of STAR☆ANIS!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:42.180
Please prepare your minds and bodies

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:46.310
for our unforgettable summer present to you, the Summer Tour!

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.720
I'm all burned out.

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:51.020
But this, too, is Aikatsu.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.140
God, Buddha, and Aoi-sama. {I think this is better}

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:56.550
Aoi, seems like your preparation for the press conference really paid off.

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:58.110
You prepared for this?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.620
Just in case, I read up on famous scandals

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:03.240
and celebrity divorce announcements...

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:06.240
But in the heat of the moment I forgot everything.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.520
No, your follow-ups were perfect.

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:11.700
Especially the part about the 
unforgettable summer present.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.420
Yeah! I felt my heart skip a beat.

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.750
Really? I said it on the spur of the moment.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.800
An unforgettable summer...

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.670
Sounds like you've had one before.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.510
Yeah, what about you?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:27.520
I've been working since I was in elementary school, so I've never really had a summer vacation.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:30.170
How about you, Ichigo? Any nice memories?

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:33.520
I once sunburned my back so bad that I couldn't even lie down on it.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.080
Another time Raichi and I were battling a stag beetle

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.020
when it suddenly started pulling our noses all the way out to here.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:42.500
Now <i>that</i> sounds like a textbook summer vacation.

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.780
Good work today, honeys.

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.670
Time to get ready for the next Special Audition, yeah!

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:53.290
Oh no!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.970
I totally blanked on the fact that it was time for the next Special Audition.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:00.890
And on top of that, it's for the Mastery of Dance.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:02.710
No wonder it's so crowded.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.970
Ready honey? Let's dance! {I think?}

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:05.970
Yes!

00:06:06.570 --> 00:06:10.380
I really wanted to get Johnny-sensei's help on this, but it's starting to look impossible.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:13.220
Oh, check this out. The group lessons are all filled up,

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.310
but there are still plenty of short one-on-ones open.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.460
Let's brush up on our weak points with Johnny-sensei alone,

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.230
and then take care of teamwork later.

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.890
Good idea. I'll even forgive that proud look.

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:25.440
Wha— already?!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.260
Done and done.

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:29.740
Aoi, Ran, what times do you want?

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.270
Let's see...

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.990
What's wrong, Aoi?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.960
Futuring Girl just announced a new Premium dress.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:41.010
You really are Futuring Girl's biggest fan, Aoi.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:41.820
Yep!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.590
These were my first Premium cards.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.970
I always carry them as a good luck charm.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:52.340
I'd love to have this new Premium dress too.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:55.020
Looks like time for another visit to the top designer.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:57.690
Yeah, I'm gonna go ask the headmistress right away.

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:03.860
Aoi-tan!

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:06.860
If it isn't the talk of the town, Powa Powa Puririn!

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:10.280
Do you also have a meeting with the headmistress, Aoi-sama?

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.980
Yeah, you too?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.610
We were just conversing about STAR☆ANIS.

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:16.490
And? Well?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:22.010
I told her Otome would think about whether she could join but stay with Powa Powa Puririn at the same time.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.670
You're not joining?

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.600
Is PowaPuri even that busy yet?

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:27.300
We are!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.850
We taste test cakes and snacks.

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:32.890
There's also watering flowers, cloud watching,

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:37.350
and even occasionally observing ants swarm about a piece of candy.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.850
That's a <i>really</i> wide range of activities.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.980
We're pretty much doing <i>idle</i> activities here. {I am impressed with myself} {I am pretty impressed with you too}

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.310
PowaPuri's not gonna stop any time soon!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:51.610
I let the headmistress know that I believe I am still far too inexperienced to think of joining STAR☆ANIS.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.550
I asked for some time to think about it too.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:56.370
But still, a summer tour...

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.620
It's going to be Love You! {capitalize? I realize I did it at first but not any more} {I think we should do it when it's clearly ungrammatical}

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.530
Even though Mizuki-san will be there too,

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.260
their conviction isn't wavering.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:06.880
I just can't hate that they're sticking to their own path.

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.880
Headmistress, I'm coming in.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.550
My eyes are spinning...

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.780
Your center of balance is way off, Starmiya-honey.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.680
Keep your eyes fixed on a single point, and you won't get dizzy.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:24.400
We don't have much time, but if I make the training three times harder, you'll have no problems!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.400
There's more spinning to be done! Let's dance!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:30.480
Aoi, how'd it go? Does it look like you'll be able to meet the top designer?

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.010
Okay!

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:34.990
The headmistress is talking to the 
Futuring Girl office for me right now.

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.580
My heart's all aflutter.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.910
You've met him before, so I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:44.700
Ichigo told me once that left turns were her weakness.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.040
We might actually be better off with the personal lessons.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.550
Every once in a while you get this really motherly look on your face.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.740
I can't help but want to take care of her.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.550
You've known each other since elementary school, right?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:09:00.060
We did go to the same school, but we only became friends in the summer of fifth grade.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.060
Ichigo and I were in different classes too.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:08.880
Back then, Ichigo still intended to follow in her mother's footsteps and inherit the bento shop,

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.140
so we didn't really have anything in common.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.270
Then how did you become friends?

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:16.170
They hold a Bon Festival in our neighborhood every year. {I know she's just talking about the dance, but you hold the whole thing}

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:19.720
Oh, right! I think I have a rare shot from back then.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.160
Way too rare! {if we've been using "rare" to describe pictures and stuff I think it's fine, though what you had is fine too}

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.960
I took this picture when I first met Ichigo.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.960
I was a huge fan of the cultural idol, Guppy, back in fifth grade. {eh, cultural} {I seem to remember reading somewhere that "bunka" was used in post-war Japan advertising as a catch-all good term... I think it had a connotation of "new-and-improved" at the time but there was more... man I wish I remembered, this stuff is hard to google}

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.960
I was already well on my way to becoming the idol professor back then.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.970
Oh gosh! Guppy's coming to our Bon dance!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.590
I just <i>have</i> to go!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:41.310
Sun, sun, sun, shining bright in the sky!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:45.750
My midsummer vacation's gonna heat right up! {also, Toyosaki Aki?}{can't hear this} {this is like the least important line in the whole episode} {also, you can't "also" without saying something first}

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.750
Guppy's the cutest!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:49.100
Is someone over there?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.000
That girl was Ichigo.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:59.110
Her dancing was way off the mark, and as a fan I wanted to stop her,

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:03.490
but Ichigo had such a bright smile on her face that I couldn't bear to look away.

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.500
Hey, no! That's not how it goes!

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.120
Stop!

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.270
Guppy doesn't swing her arms around like that.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.070
She's like this, and this.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:15.970
Spin, spin, spin! {just realized this is a left turn too... the detail...}

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.040
Huh? Th-This?

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.580
Put your right hand like this!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.070
That was my first conversation with Ichigo.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.810
And that was your unforgettable summer?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:30.520
If I hadn't met Ichigo back then, I might not've become an idol.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:34.450
Ichigo was the one who nudged me onto the path to idolhood.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.650
Huh, really?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:39.510
Things really got crazy after that...

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:42.160
I can't go on...

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.440
The Earth is spinning...

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.630
Next.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:49.710
Coming.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.830
Good luck.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:51.550
Kiriya.

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:58.150
The moment I got on the phone with 
Futuring Girl to talk about the Premium dress,

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:01.580
they told me to send you over as soon as possible.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:02.090
And?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:05.930
It seems that they may have to cancel the new Premium dress announcement.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.060
What?

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:11.210
The top designer, Rei, has locked himself inside a shell.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.450
I'm heading over now.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.290
Will you really be fine by yourself?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.540
I'm not sure what I'll be able to do, but I can't just ignore something like this.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.920
We've been waiting for you, Kiriya-san.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:41.180
This new Premium dress is a masterpiece far surpassing all of his previous works.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.430
Then why are you canceling the announcement?

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:50.430
Futuring Girl's mantra is to create dresses which show a wondrous future to those who wear them.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.420
A wondrous future to those who wear them...

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:56.750
The top designer Rei is hesitating because he believes

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.940
that his new dress has yet to approach the pinnacle of his ideal.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.950
Even though it's already a masterpiece?

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:06.340
Artists often go through periods like this.

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:09.750
They back themselves into a corner in their search for perfection.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.350
However, Kiriya-san,

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:15.330
I believe that you have the power to give Rei the courage to break out of his shell of doubt.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:22.480
Rei is always talking about how you are one of the few people who fully understand Futuring Girl's intentions.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.470
Please wait a moment!

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:28.350
Are you telling me to bring the top designer back all on my own?

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.770
That's right.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:33.980
All of us here at Futuring Girl wish to stand proud when we announce

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.100
his brand-new dress.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.900
He's just past this door.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.480
None of us are allowed inside.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:43.490
We're all counting on you to bring him back to us.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.560
I'll try!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:52.000
I never imagined he'd actually be inside a shell...

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.100
I'm Kiriya Aoi from Starlight Academy.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:13:01.200
We've met before. You gave me my first Premium dress cards.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:02.870
Do you remember me?

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:09.390
Darn that receptionist! What am I supposed to do here?

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:14.770
Wow, no way!

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:19.650
This is the new Futuring Girl Premium dress...

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.400
Isn't that right?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:27.800
Everything from the tiara to the boots is shining with light from the gentle mix of colors.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.660
It's incredibly beautiful! {incredible beautiful sounds very... German}

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.370
Is this a mirror?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:35.540
The subtle weave of each piece makes it look like a kaleidoscope! {why doesn't the spellchecker catch kaleidescope?}

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:40.420
I read about this in your interview on the Futuring Girl website.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.790
The secret behind how the tulle skirt can change colors

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:47.650
lies in the futuristic material, Kaleido-mirror.

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:50.650
It was Futuring Girl that developed the technique

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:53.930
of using jewel beetle wings as clothing material.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.280
<i>It really is a wondrous dress...</i>

00:13:56.280 --> 00:14:00.190
<i>Even if I don't get to wear it, I can't let this remain in the dark.</i>

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:04.380
<i>To do that, I need to first get Rei-san out of his shell...</i>

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:06.200
<i>I just wish I knew how...</i>

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:22.400
These are my first Futuring Girl Premium Rare cards.

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:26.670
This is the coord I wore during my first Special Audition with Ichigo and Ran.

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:31.450
This is the precious dress that turned me, Kiriya Aoi, into a real idol.

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:34.110
But the first time I came upon Futuring Girl

00:14:34.110 --> 00:14:37.850
was long before I knew about Starlight Academy or idols.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.440
"That's so pretty..."

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:45.820
Back then, I never dreamed that I would ever get the chance to wear such an amazing dress.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.580
It didn't take long for me to forget all about it,

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:52.950
but soon after, I suddenly developed my interest in the idol world.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:57.830
I dropped everything I was doing, and became engrossed in idols.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:03.340
But the first time I thought of becoming an idol myself was on that fateful summer night...

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.440
I was teaching my friend how to do an idol's dance correctly,

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:11.840
when she decided it was time to unknowingly change my entire life.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:12.850
Come here!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:14.690
Let's dance together!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:20.730
You were really good at it just now!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.190
You were just like a real idol!

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:27.480
That was the moment I first stepped foot on stage...

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:31.490
The moment I went from watching to being watched.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.180
Could I become an idol too?

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.290
That's when things changed.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:40.500
The one who made me want to be an idol,

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:45.500
and the one who's lit my way all this time is my best friend, Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.630
From the day I first saw one...

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.130
And the day I first wore one...

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.140
Every Futuring Girl dress...

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:59.120
I love Futuring Girl with all of my heart.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:03.000
I've waited so long for you to announce your new dress.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:08.150
I want to join hands with Ichigo and Ran, and take my Special Audition wearing that dress!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:13.150
That's the best dress I've ever seen in my life!

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.170
Rei-san...

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.750
Good to see you again, Kiriya Aoi-kun.

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:33.180
I've always been watching you.

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.180
Thank you.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:39.950
I was so caught up in achieving perfection that I had forgotten something important. {cliche!}

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:44.020
Dresses are completed only when someone wears them.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:55.910
Futuring Girl's mantra

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:59.780
is to create dresses which are able to show a wondrous future to those who wear them.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.210
I can see it.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:09.800
Your brilliantly shining future of wearing the Kaleido-Mirror coord. {capital because it's the name of the coord, not the material}

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.570
Thank you so much!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.300
Where's today's last honey?

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.370
No honey?

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:18.800
Wait, wait, wait! I'm coming!

00:17:19.990 --> 00:17:22.930
Kiriya Aoi here for individual lessons. Sorry I'm late!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.610
Oh, Kiriya.

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.780
You've done an excellent job today.

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:29.680
I reward you with ten times the lesson time!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.280
Really? Oh, thank you.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.450
All right, Kiriya-honey, let's dance!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.590
Okay, I'll do my best!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:40.740
Ichigo, do you remember the day you met Aoi?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.900
Of course. {I use this too much...} {it's fine}

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.030
I met Aoi at the Bon dance.

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:47.210
She came to my shop to buy a bento some time after that.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.750
Here's your deluxe bento.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.530
Is that me? {does nandemo bento always do this}

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:54.590
Oh, wait a minute... this is for you.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.970
It's kinda embarrassing.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.900
I just happened to take it.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:04.240
I'm Kiriya Aoi from the class next to yours. Well, see you.

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.310
I'm...

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.840
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo. Thanks for the photo.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.440
Aoi-chan, see you later!

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.190
And that's your unforgettable summer.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:16.670
What is it?

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.970
Aoi's looking a bit tired, so how about we go give her a hand?

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:20.830
Sure!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.370
And then came the day of the Special Audition.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:54.830
Yay!

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.330
We got the Mastery of Dance!

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:01.660
Dance is the alignment of one's heart to a rhythm.

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:05.470
By aligning everyone's hearts, the stage becomes even more fired up.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:10.400
We all got the Mastery too!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.830
Mizuki-san.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:20.440
Now, let's all work together to turn this summer into an unforgettable memory for STAR☆ANIS as well.

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:23.730
STAR☆ANIS, start!

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.620
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism.

00:23:58.550 --> 00:24:00.340
Your dress today was so pretty.

00:24:00.340 --> 00:24:02.640
Thanks! I'm glad everyone else got to see it too.

00:24:02.640 --> 00:24:04.680
Rei-san was really happy about it.

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:06.300
You were really shining too!

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:09.760
Dresses are not complete until they are worn.

00:24:10.610 --> 00:24:13.710
STAR☆ANIS's summer tour is about to begin!

00:24:13.710 --> 00:24:15.750
Yeah, let's get ready to go!

00:24:15.750 --> 00:24:18.520
But the weather report's forecasting a typhoon?!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:19.950
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.950 --> 00:24:21.260
Summer-colored miracle.

00:24:21.260 --> 00:24:25.720
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
